Dialogue: 2,0:00:15.84,0:00:18.19,Apoio,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,615)\fad(150,250)}10 diferenças
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.31,0:00:24.10,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Aqui é a Pixelzada.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.12,0:00:26.96,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Antes de começar, um combinado: tudo o que eu
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.98,0:00:29.76,Legenda,,0,0,0,,falar sobre GTA 6 vem dos trailers, do vídeo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.78,0:00:31.72,Legenda,,0,0,0,,de gameplay e do site oficial.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.74,0:00:34.30,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Na quinta, com o jogo na mão, a gente confere
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.32,0:00:35.48,Legenda,,0,0,0,,o que se confirmou.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.50,0:00:36.69,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Bora para a lista.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.71,0:00:39.60,Legenda,,0,0,0,,E fica até o fim, porque a diferença número
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.62,0:00:42.45,Legenda,,0,0,0,,dez mexe com quem joga GTA Online há anos.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.27,0:00:27.83,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA 6 · GAMEPLAY
