Dialogue: 1,0:02:50.11,0:03:21.90,Capitulo,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}4. A ÁGUA
Dialogue: 2,0:02:59.69,0:03:03.29,Grande,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs150\fad(100,250)\move(-30,860,110,860,0,260)\1c&H00D6E62E\shad6\4c&H40240612}METADE DO MAPA
Dialogue: 2,0:02:59.89,0:03:03.29,Apoio,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(118,878)\fad(150,250)}pântano, canais, marinas e ilhas
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.90,0:03:25.55,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Diferença número cinco: as redes sociais.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.57,0:03:28.52,Legenda,,0,0,0,,GTA 5 já brincava com isso, com a Lifeinvader,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.54,0:03:31.42,Legenda,,0,0,0,,a paródia do Facebook, e o Bleeter, a paródia
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.44,0:03:32.27,Legenda,,0,0,0,,do Twitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.29,0:03:34.55,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Mas era coisa de menu no celular.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.57,0:03:37.85,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Nos trailers de GTA 6, os vídeos verticais de
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.87,0:03:40.73,Legenda,,0,0,0,,rede social estão por toda parte: gente
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.75,0:03:43.61,Legenda,,0,0,0,,filmando briga, dancinha, perseguição e
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.63,0:03:44.30,Legenda,,0,0,0,,jacaré.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.32,0:03:46.40,Legenda,,0,0,0,,A internet virou parte do mundo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.42,0:03:49.23,Legenda,,0,0,0,,E faz sentido: a Flórida é famosa justamente
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.25,0:03:51.64,Legenda,,0,0,0,,pelos vídeos absurdos que circulam na
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.66,0:03:52.37,Legenda,,0,0,0,,internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.39,0:03:55.35,Legenda,,0,0,0,,A Rockstar pegou essa fama e colocou dentro do
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.37,0:03:55.84,Legenda,,0,0,0,,jogo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.86,0:03:58.58,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Ainda não se sabe se você vai poder postar
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.60,0:04:01.31,Legenda,,0,0,0,,seus próprios vídeos, mas o mundo de GTA 6
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.33,0:04:03.44,Legenda,,0,0,0,,claramente está sempre filmando.
