Dialogue: 2,0:04:38.64,0:04:42.24,Grande,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs150\fad(100,250)\move(-30,860,110,860,0,260)\1c&H00428CFF\shad6\4c&H40240612}GROTTI CHEETAH
Dialogue: 2,0:04:38.84,0:04:42.24,Apoio,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(118,878)\fad(150,250)}de volta
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.39,0:05:00.12,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Diferença número oito: os animais.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.14,0:05:04.05,Legenda,,0,0,0,,GTA 5 tinha cachorro, puma, tubarão e até a
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.07,0:05:06.36,Legenda,,0,0,0,,vaca no meio da estrada.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.38,0:05:08.73,Legenda,,0,0,0,,GTA 6 aposta no que a Flórida tem de mais
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.75,0:05:09.70,Legenda,,0,0,0,,famoso: jacaré.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.72,0:05:12.97,Legenda,,0,0,0,,No pântano, na estrada e, sim, dentro de loja
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.99,0:05:16.11,Legenda,,0,0,0,,de conveniência, igual àqueles vídeos reais
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.13,0:05:17.88,Legenda,,0,0,0,,que viralizam todo ano.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.90,0:05:20.59,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Os trailers também mostram cervos, iguanas e
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.61,0:05:22.08,Legenda,,0,0,0,,pássaros por todo lado.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.10,0:05:24.89,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Em GTA 5, os animais eram quase decoração.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.91,0:05:27.40,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Em Leonida, eles parecem fazer parte do caos
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.42,0:05:28.25,Legenda,,0,0,0,,do dia a dia.
